{
  "id": 443639320,
  "iid": 23020,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "capture: Use pcap_init on Windows if we have it",
  "description": "On Windows, use pcap_init if present to request that error strings be\nreturned in UTF-8 instead of the local code page, so we don't have to\ntranslate them. This also keeps pcap_create from trying to determine\nif the device string passed in is in UTF-16LE (which the deprecated\nand disabled by this option pcap_lookupdev would return).\n\nThis function was first added in libpcap 1.10.0",
  "state": "merged",
